sapicli SAPI HTTP Server\par
\par
This software is provided as-is, without warranty of any kind. By installing, you acknowledge you have permission to deploy a Windows service on this machine.\par
\par
sapicli registers a Windows service \b sapisrv\b0  that listens on \b http://+:8080/\b0 , reads its API-key configuration from \b %ProgramData%\\sapicli\\keys.json\b0 , and writes logs to \b %ProgramData%\\sapicli\\logs\\\b0 .\par
\par
On uninstall the service is stopped and removed; \b %ProgramData%\\sapicli\\\b0  is intentionally preserved so your keys and logs survive a reinstall.\par
